t": 0, "end": 194, "text": "Bert Smith (footballer, born 1896) Ernest Edwin \"Bert\" Smith (born 4 January 1896, date of death unknown) was a professional footballer who played for Cardiff and then Middlesbrough and Watford."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "start": 195, "end": 218, "text": "He was born in Donegal."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "start": 219, "end": 300, "text": "He was capped four times by Ireland, captaining the team against England in 1922."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "start": 301, "end": 391, "text": "Smith was born of English parents and his father worked as a lighthouse keeper in Donegal."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "start": 392, "end": 476, "text": "Smith's football career began during World War I when he played for the Indian army."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "start": 477, "end": 580, "text": "On his return to Britain he joined Cardiff City for the start of the 1919-1920 season as they played in"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "on October 20, 2017."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 21, "end": 111, "text": "Kowalski received a Lifetime Achievement Award from the Improved Order of Red Men in 2016."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 112, "end": 191, "text": "In addition, the Veterans of Foreign Wars presents an award named in his honor."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 192, "end": 309, "text": "Stan Kowalski Stan Kowalski (born Bert Smith; May 13, 1926 – October 20, 2017) was an American professional wrestler."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 310, "end": 448, "text": "He was one half of the tag team Murder Incorporated with partner Tiny Mills in the American Wrestling Association (AWA) from 1960 to 1975."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 449, "end": 508, "text": "Kowalski wrestled and played football at North High School."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 509, "end": 549, "text": "Afterward, at age 17, he joined the U.S."}, "D4S8": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "start": 550, "end": 588, "text": "Navy and served on a Pacific submarine"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d04", "start": 0, "end": 221, "text": "to the injury of Danny Guthrie , Smith partnered Joey Barton for the 3–0 loss to former club Manchester United , the 6–0 victory over Aston Villa , the 1–1 draw with Wolverhampton Wanderers and the 2–0 loss to Blackpool ."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d04", "start": 222, "end": 303, "text": "He lost his place to new signing Cheick Tioté and the arrival of Hatem Ben Arfa ."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d04", "start": 304, "end": 474, "text": "Smith was given time in the Football League Cup , where Chris Hughton gave young players and fringe players such as himself , Ryan Taylor and Peter Løvenkrands a chance ."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d04", "start": 475, "end": 543, "text": "With Tioté cementing his place as the in-form defensive midfielder ,"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "7 March 1892", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "12 October 1900", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "4 January 1896", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C3", "answer": "May 13, 1926", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d00:c0", "entity": "Bert Smith", "scope": "birth date", "claim": "Bertram \"Bert\" Smith was born on 7 March 1892.", "answer": "7 March 1892", "quote": "Bert Smith (footballer, born 1892) Bertram \"Bert\" Smith (7 March 1892 – September 1969) was a professional footballer, who played for Huddersfield Town, Tottenham Hotspur and played international football for England.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d01:c0", "entity": "Bert Smith", "scope": "date of birth", "claim": "Bert Smith was born on 12 October 1900.", "answer": "12 October 1900", "quote": "0 references date of birth 12 October 1900 Gregorian", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d02:c0", "entity": "Bert Smith", "scope": "birth date", "claim": "Ernest Edwin \"Bert\" Smith was born on 4 January 1896.", "answer": "4 January 1896", "quote": "Bert Smith (footballer, born 1896) Ernest Edwin \"Bert\" Smith (born 4 January 1896, date of death unknown) was a professional footballer who played for Cardiff and then Middlesbrough and Watford.", "original_document_number": 3}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0447-47bcb831e747:d03:c0", "entity": "Bert Smith", "scope": "Birth date", "claim": "Stan Kowalski (born Bert Smith; May 13, 1926 – October 20, 2017) was an American professional wrestler.", "answer": "May 13, 1926", "quote": "Stan Kowalski Stan Kowalski (born Bert Smith; May 13, 1926 – October 20, 2017) was an American professional wrestler.", "original_document_number": 4}], "initial_answers": ["7 March 1892", "12 October 1900", "4 January 1896", "May 13, 1926"]}

